'''Seaside''' is a resort town located on the western coast of [[Sacred Grove]]. It has a tropical climate and has a great view of the ocean from the Boardwalk and the beach. Seaside used to be known for it's quiet serenity, but after a dramatic increase in population and travelers, it has since been a polluted, restless place to go for vacation and trade. Many players have [[Trading Center]] at the Vollyball Net or [[Diggy|Diggy's]] [[Ocean Treasures Cafe|Cafe]], both located nearest to the coast.
